# Cloudinary Media Pipeline Integration

Replace ephemeral disk uploads with a Cloudinary signed direct upload pipeline. Backend never proxies file bytes.

**Flow:** Frontend → `POST /api/media/signature` (Backend) → Direct POST to Cloudinary → Frontend sends metadata → Backend stores URL+public_id only.

---

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] pom.xml

#### [MODIFY] [pom.xml](file:///c:/Users/jadha/.gemini/antigravity/playground/mrsdeore/backend/pom.xml)
- Add `com.cloudinary:cloudinary-http45:1.39.0`
- Add `com.github.bucket4j:bucket4j-core:8.10.1` for rate limiting

---

### [Backend] Configuration Layer

#### [NEW] CloudinaryConfig.java
- `@Bean` reads `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME`, `CLOUDINARY_API_KEY`, `CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET` via `@Value`.
- No secrets in code. No secrets in [application.yml](file:///c:/Users/jadha/.gemini/antigravity/playground/mrsdeore/backend/src/main/resources/application.yml).

#### [NEW] CloudinaryService.java
Central abstraction. Methods:
- `generateUploadSignature(MediaType type, Long entityId)` → `Map<String,Object>` with signed params
  - Folder: `categories/`, `products/{id}/`, `documents/`
  - Enforces: max size, allowed formats, auto quality/format (`f_auto`, `q_auto`)
  - Validates `MediaType` → maps to correct Cloudinary resource_type (`image`/`video`/`raw`)
- `deleteMedia(String publicId, String resourceType)` → void, logs on failure (no exception thrown)

#### [MODIFY] [application.yml](file:///c:/Users/jadha/.gemini/antigravity/playground/mrsdeore/backend/src/main/resources/application.yml)
- Add `app.cloudinary.cloud-name`, `api-key`, `api-secret` binding stubs (values from env vars, no defaults).
- Add `app.media.max-file-size-mb: 10` and `app.media.allowed-formats: jpg,jpeg,png,webp,mp4`

---

### [Backend] Signature Endpoint

#### [MODIFY] [FileUploadController.java](file:///c:/Users/jadha/.gemini/antigravity/playground/mrsdeore/backend/src/main/java/com/mrsdeores/controllers/FileUploadController.java)
- **Rename/Remap** to `MediaController.java` at `POST /api/media/signature`
- `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")` — Admin only
- **Rate-limited** with Bucket4j: max 30 signatures/minute per admin (stops spam abuse)
- Accepts body: `{ "mediaType": "CATEGORY"|"PRODUCT"|"DOCUMENT", "entityId": optional }`
- Returns signed params only — no file bytes cross the backend
- **Old `/api/upload` endpoint removed** entirely

---

### [Backend] Schema Migration

#### [NEW] V19__Add_Cloudinary_Media_Fields.sql
```sql
ALTER TABLE product_images ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS public_id VARCHAR(255);
ALTER TABLE product_images ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS resource_type VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'image';
ALTER TABLE categories    ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS public_id VARCHAR(255);
ALTER TABLE categories    ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS resource_type VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'image';
```
> Old rows get `NULL` public_id — backward compatible, existing image_urls still display.

