## Verification Plan

### Automated
- `mvn clean package -DskipTests` — verifies Cloudinary SDK resolves
- Flyway: `V19` migration applies on clean Render deploy

### Manual
1. Upload category image → URL is `res.cloudinary.com/dyfpdcteo/...`
2. Update category with new image → old image removed from Cloudinary media library
3. Old categories with `NULL` public_id display correctly (backward compat)
4. Verify no files written to `/app/uploads` (no disk usage)
5. Try hitting `/api/media/signature` as non-admin → `403 Forbidden`
